<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 9.9 pct in year to September.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 9.9 pct in year to September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for September -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				   SEPT	(PREL SEPT)</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)	    +0.8	   +0.8</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)	    +9.9	   +9.8</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	  +0.8	   +0.7</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)	  +9.8	   +9.8</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg		 3.7	  3.5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
